From 60fd7435a219295e5a057ee9146c8ba77b85caf9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 10:08:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/34] vulkan: fuse RMS_NORM + weight + sign + FWHT
 (fwht_norm) in front of Hadamard-folded mat-vecs

One workgroup per (row, 1024-block); each re-reduces the L2-resident row so blocks run in parallel. The weighted
norm is also written when it has other consumers (GDN alpha/beta). GGML_VK_DISABLE_NORM_FWHT turns it off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
